      {
        icon: 'api', tone: 'butter', demo: ['POST /jobs · 202', 'GET /jobs/{id} · 200'],
        name: 'HTTP API',
        text: 'Routes are built from templates: CRUD, async job, file upload, list, webhook. Each has a method, a path, a status code and fields.',
      },
      {
        icon: 'calc', tone: 'peach', demo: ['28 req/s', '556 in flight', '2.2 TB'],
        name: 'Back-of-the-envelope',
        text: 'Enter users, writes and a peak factor, get requests per second, concurrent requests by Little’s law and stored data with replicas. The calculator nudges you when it’s time to think about caching, sharding or a CDN, and one click turns a result into a non-functional requirement.',
      },
      {
        icon: 'compare', tone: 'sage', demo: ['Kafka ↔ SQS', 'Postgres ↔ Cassandra'],
        name: 'Technology comparison',
        text: 'For queues, databases, caches, object storage and search. When to pick one, when to avoid it and what to ask the candidate next. Kafka vs SQS in one table.',
      },
      {
        icon: 'schema', tone: 'mint', demo: ['PK', 'FK', 'PART', 'SORT', 'SQL · CQL'],
        name: 'Data schemas',
        text: 'Attach tables and message types to any block, with PK, FK, PART and SORT keys. DDL for SQL and CQL is generated for you.',
      },
      {
        icon: 'check', tone: 'rose', wide: true, demo: ['orphan block', 'FR-3 with no block', 'NFR-4 with no number', 'single point of failure'],
        name: 'Checks',
        text: 'The playground flags a block with no connections, a requirement with no block, a property with no number and a single point of failure. The interviewer also sees where the answer differs from the reference.',
      },
    ],
    practiceTitle: 'You can practise on your own',
    practiceLead: 'The same scenario can be done solo, to prepare for an interview or to warm up before one.',
    practice: [
      'Practice runs in five steps: requirements, API, design, load estimates, weak spots. The next step opens once the checks on the current one turn green.',
      'Along the way you get twists like “traffic grew tenfold” or “an availability zone went down”. The design has to change.',
      'At the end you get a score and a snapshot of the checks. It can’t be edited afterwards.',
      'A practice link opens without signing in. The task, the checks and the hints are there; the reference isn’t.',
    ],
    flowTitle: 'How it works',
    flow: [
      ['Prepare a scenario', 'Task, reference, hints, rubric and questions. Done once, then reused for every candidate.'],
      ['Schedule the interview', 'Enter the candidate’s email and a time. They get a link, and the event goes to the calendar.'],
      ['Wait for the candidate', 'You’ll see them join even if the tab is in the background. Press Start, the candidate gets the task, the clock is running.'],
      ['Run the conversation', 'Reveal hints and the calculator, tick off questions, draw on the board, ask the AI assistant.'],
      ['Score', 'From 0 to 3 per criterion, with weights. Each interviewer scores on their own. The candidate leaves feedback at the end.'],
      ['Compare', 'For one candidate there’s a report with a board replay. For every candidate on the scenario, a calibration table.'],
    ],
    privacyTitle: 'Who sees what',
    privacy: [
      'Permissions are checked in the database, not in the UI. The candidate gets only the task and their own board, and the task only after the start. They never see the reference, the rubric or anyone’s notes.',
      'A finished interview can’t be restarted, and the candidate’s board is frozen once it ends.',
      'Without signing in, the playground runs entirely in the browser. Designs are kept in its storage, and a scenario or an answer can be passed around as a JSON file.',
    ],
    exampleTitle: 'A worked example',
    example:
      'The scraping jobs write-up goes through the whole thing: the task, clarifying questions, requirements, estimates, C1, C2 and C3 diagrams and a check of every decision against the requirements.',
    exampleLink: 'Open the write-up',
    finalTitle: 'Start with the ready-made scenario',
    finalText: 'The playground ships with an example: a URL shortener with a reference, hints and a rubric. You can switch between roles without signing in and see how it all fits together. For a live interview, sign in with Google.',
  },
}[lang];

const playground = localePath(lang, 'playground');


---

<Base lang={lang} title={copy.title} description={copy.description} path="landing/system-design-interview">
  <div class="landing">
    <section class="hero" data-reveal>
      <div class="hero__text">
        <p class="hero__eyebrow">{copy.eyebrow}</p>
        <h1 class="hero__title">{copy.heading}</h1>
        <p class="hero__lead">{copy.lead}</p>
        <div class="hero__actions">
          <a class="btn btn--primary" href={playground}>{copy.open} →</a>
          <a class="hero__link" href="#flow">{copy.how}</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <figure class="hero__art" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src={assetPath('covers/system-design-interview.svg')} alt="" width="640" height="300" />
      </figure>
    </section>

    <section class="pain" data-reveal>
      <h2>{copy.painTitle}</h2>
      <ul>{copy.pain.map((item) => <li>{item}</li>)}</ul>
      <p>{copy.painAfter}</p>
    </section>

    <section class="roles" data-reveal>
      <h2>{copy.rolesTitle}</h2>
      <div class="roles__grid">
        {
          copy.roles.map((role) => (
            <article class={`role role--${role.key}`} data-reveal-item>
              <h3>{role.name}</h3>
              <ul>{role.points.map((point) => <li>{point}</li>)}</ul>
            </article>
          ))
        }
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="features" data-reveal>
      <h2>{copy.liveTitle}</h2>
      <BoardDemo lang={lang} />
      <FeatureGrid cards={copy.live} />
    </section>

    <section class="ai" data-reveal>
      <h2>{copy.aiTitle}</h2>
      <div class="ai__layout">
        <AssistantDemo lang={lang} />
        <div class="ai__grid">
        {
          copy.ai.map((card) => (
            <article class="ai__card" data-reveal-item>
              <div class="ai__top">
                <span class="ai__tile">
                  <Icon name="spark" />
                </span>
                <h3>{card.name}</h3>
              </div>
              <ul>{card.points.map((point) => <li>{point}</li>)}</ul>
            </article>
          ))
        }
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="ai__keys">{copy.aiKeys}</p>
    </section>

    <section class="features" data-reveal>
      <h2>{copy.featuresTitle}</h2>
      <FeatureGrid cards={copy.features} />
    </section>

    <section class="practice" data-reveal>
      <h2>{copy.practiceTitle}</h2>
      <p class="practice__lead">{copy.practiceLead}</p>
      <ul class="practice__list">{copy.practice.map((item) => <li data-reveal-item>{item}</li>)}</ul>
    </section>

    <section class="steps" id="flow" data-reveal>
      <h2>{copy.flowTitle}</h2>
      <div class="flow__layout">
      <ol class="flow__list">
        {
          copy.flow.map(([name, text], i) => (
            <li class="flow__step" data-reveal-item>
              <span class="flow__num">{i + 1}</span>
              <div>
                <h3>{name}</h3>
                <p>{text}</p>
              </div>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ol>
        <div class="flow__demo">
          <ReportDemo lang={lang} />
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="aside-pair" data-reveal>
      <article class="note">
        <h2>{copy.privacyTitle}</h2>
        {copy.privacy.map((item) => <p>{item}</p>)}
      </article>
      <article class="note">
        <h2>{copy.exampleTitle}</h2>
        <p>{copy.example}</p>
        <a class="hero__link" href={localePath(lang, 'lessons/scraping-jobs')}>{copy.exampleLink} →</a>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="final" data-reveal>
      <h2>{copy.finalTitle}</h2>
      <p>{copy.finalText}</p>
      <a class="btn btn--primary" href={playground}>{copy.open} →</a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Base>

<script>
  import { animate, inView, stagger } from 'motion';

  /**
   * Секции проявляются, когда до них доскроллили; карточки внутри — одна за
   * другой. Без JS и при reduced motion всё видно сразу: скрытие ставит сам
   * скрипт, а не CSS.
   */
  if (!matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches) {
    document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-reveal]').forEach((section) => {
      const items = section.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-reveal-item]');
      section.style.opacity = '0';
      items.forEach((item) => (item.style.opacity = '0'));

      inView(
        section,
        () => {
          animate(section, { opacity: [0, 1], y: [18, 0] }, { duration: 0.5, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] });
          if (items.length) {
            animate(
              items,
              { opacity: [0, 1], y: [14, 0] },
              { delay: stagger(0.07, { startDelay: 0.12 }), duration: 0.45, ease: [0.22, 1, 0.36, 1] },
            );
          }
        },
        { amount: 0.15 },
      );
    });
  }
</script>

<style>
  .landing {
    display: grid;
    gap: 4.5rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 0 3rem;
  }

  h2 {
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }

  h3 {
    margin: 0 0 0.4rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  /* ---------- первый экран ---------- */

  .hero {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero__eyebrow {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .hero__title {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    line-height: 1.12;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .hero__lead {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    max-width: 36rem;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .hero__actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    margin-top: 1.6rem;
  }

  .btn--primary {
    padding: 0.65rem 1.15rem;
    border-radius: 999px;
    border-color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--accent);
    color: var(--panel);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  /* Общее `.btn:hover` красит текст в синий — на синем фоне кнопки он
     пропадал. Здесь у кнопки свои цвета на все состояния: текст всегда
     светлый, меняется только фон. */
  .btn.btn--primary:hover:not(:disabled),
  .btn.btn--primary:focus-visible,
  .btn.btn--primary:active {
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 82%, var(--fg));
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 82%, var(--fg));
    color: var(--panel);
  }

  .hero__link {
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .hero__link:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  /* Акварель на тёплой бумаге — как обложки разборов в каталоге. */
  .hero__art {
    margin: 0;
    border-radius: 16px;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, #efe6d6 55%, var(--panel));
    box-shadow: 0 10px 40px var(--shadow);
  }

  .hero__art img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  /* ---------- боль ---------- */

  .pain {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  .pain ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .pain p {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ---------- роли ---------- */

  .roles__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  /* Цвет роли — полоса сверху: те же три тона, что у кружков на иллюстрации. */
  .role {
    --role: #c9a24a;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.2rem 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-top: 3px solid var(--role);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--panel);
  }

  .role--candidate {
    --role: #5b9bd0;
  }

  .role--interviewer {
    --role: #8a70c9;
  }

  .role ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .role li + li {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  /* ---------- ИИ ---------- */

  /* Слева — макет помощника, справа — что он умеет и ИИ-интервьюер. */
  .ai__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .ai__grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  /* Тон ИИ — лавандовый, как у роли интервьюера: помощник работает на него. */
  .ai__card {
    --tone: #8a70c9;
    padding: 1.15rem 1.2rem 1.2rem;
    border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone) 22%, var(--border));
    border-radius: 14px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(120% 90% at 100% 0%, color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone) 10%, transparent), transparent 60%),
      var(--panel);
  }

  .ai__top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
  }

  .ai__top h3 {
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai__tile {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    flex: none;
    width: 2.3rem;
    height: 2.3rem;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--tone) 16%, var(--panel));
    color: var(--tone);
  }

  .ai__card ul {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.1rem;
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .ai__card li + li {
    margin-top: 0.35rem;
  }

  .ai__keys {
    max-width: 44rem;
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ---------- тренировка ---------- */

  .practice {
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  .practice__lead {
    margin: 0 0 0.8rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .practice__list {
    margin: 0;
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .practice__list li + li {
    margin-top: 0.4rem;
  }

  /* ---------- ход собеседования ---------- */

  /* Шаги слева, справа — отчёт, которым они заканчиваются; он держится на
     экране, пока шаги прокручиваются. */
  .flow__layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 24rem);
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .flow__demo {
    position: sticky;
    top: 5rem;
  }

  .flow__list {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    max-width: 44rem;
  }

  /* Шаги стоят на вертикальной линии: номер в кружке, линия между ними. */
  .flow__step {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 2.4rem minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 0.9rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.3rem;
  }

  .flow__step:not(:last-child)::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: 1.2rem;
    top: 2.4rem;
    bottom: 0;
    width: 2px;
    background: var(--border);
  }

  .flow__num {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 2.4rem;
    height: 2.4rem;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent-soft);
    color: var(--accent);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .flow__step h3 {
    margin-top: 0.45rem;
  }

  .flow__step p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ---------- приватность и пример ---------- */

  .aside-pair {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .note {
    padding: 1.2rem 1.3rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: var(--panel);
  }

  .note h2 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .note p {
    margin: 0 0 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  /* ---------- финал ---------- */

  .final {
    padding: 2.2rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent-soft) 70%, var(--panel));
    text-align: center;
  }

  .final p {
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 52rem) {
    .hero,
    .aside-pair {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .roles__grid,
    .ai__layout,
    .flow__layout {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    .flow__demo {
      position: static;
    }
  }
</style>
